        "created_at": "2015-09-20T22:09:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A new branch of a game store just opened between my work and home and they have game nights on a day I'd be able to attend. &nbsp;I'm planning on taking Sentinels, but I have one concern. &nbsp;Do you think I should take everything, or just take a subset of the available decks in one box to not scare people off the game (at least for the first couple weeks)?</p>",
