      {
        "id": 148143,
        "name": "VisforYoshi",
        "username": "VisforYoshi",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/visforyoshi/{size}/2185_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-09-20T23:10:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"jffdougan\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jffdougan/48/1882_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> jffdougan:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I take everything, although some of that is because of how I have it stored.What I also do is lay out a game - because I usually pitch it around the Avengers, it's usually against Omnitron or Voss, laying out Legacy, Wraith, Tempest, Ra, KNYFE, Parse, Bunker, and Haka for people to pick from. Lay out the environment decks for Insula Primalis, Atlantis, and Mars; let the players come to an agreement. My experience is that they usually pick Mars and pick Insula Primalis when they don't.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I usually do those heros (along with chrono ranger), have the villains be Omnitron, Baron, or Ambuscade, and have the Time Cataclysm, Insula Primalis, The Block, or Wagner</p>",
